WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.776 --> 00:00:13.677
heard someone crying.

2
00:00:15.217 --> 00:00:18.118
Using her x-ray vision, she peered through the walls of the house.

3
00:00:19.779 --> 00:00:23.241
In a dark room, down a long hallway, Roxy saw two figures.

4
00:00:24.661 --> 00:00:26.442
One man, dressed like a monk, was crying.

5
00:00:27.062 --> 00:00:28.943
The other figure looked like a purple monster.

6
00:00:29.823 --> 00:00:31.384
Ropes bound their arms and legs.

7
00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:35.141
"This is awful, Wujing," the monk said.

8
00:00:35.161 --> 00:00:38.203
"We'll never reach the Western Paradise now!"

9
00:00:39.824 --> 00:00:42.345
"I'm sorry, Master," Wujing said.

10
00:00:42.365 --> 00:00:46.808
"When I checked the horse, demons attacked me.

11
00:00:47.708 --> 00:00:50.250
There were so many—I couldn't fight them all."

12
00:00:51.630 --> 00:00:52.811
The monk cried some more.

13
00:00:52.831 --> 00:00:57.954
"And soon we'll be eaten!"

14
00:00:57.974 --> 00:01:00.635
"Oh no!"

15
00:01:00.955 --> 00:01:01.876
Roxy blurted out.

16
00:01:02.680 --> 00:01:05.861
"The squire has prisoners—and someone is going to eat them."

17
00:01:06.782 --> 00:01:08.382
The squire walked back into the room.

18
00:01:08.402 --> 00:01:11.564
"That's right!"

19
00:01:13.285 --> 00:01:16.046
Suddenly the beautiful room turned into a gloomy cave.

20
00:01:18.507 --> 00:01:21.188
The squire grew ugly with sharp fangs and horns.

21
00:01:22.669 --> 00:01:24.209
"You're a demon!"

22
00:01:24.989 --> 00:01:25.810
Roxy gasped.

23
00:01:27.911 --> 00:01:30.652
Wukong, in the form of a car, zoomed down the street.

24
00:01:31.416 --> 00:01:33.637
He tried to catch up to the bank robbers, Dwight and Earl.

25
00:01:35.038 --> 00:01:38.020
Wukong skidded around a corner and nearly hit another car.

26
00:01:39.400 --> 00:01:40.661
The driver waved his fist.

27
00:01:40.681 --> 00:01:43.242
"Watch where you're going, you crazy driver!"

28
00:01:43.262 --> 00:01:46.544
"Sorry!" Wukong shouted.

29
00:01:49.166 --> 00:01:51.907
The robbers drove out of the city and down a long road.

30
00:01:53.988 --> 00:01:55.789
Finally they stopped near a large building.

31
00:01:58.330 --> 00:02:00.912
Wukong transformed back into himself and hid.

32
00:02:03.148 --> 00:02:05.210
The robbers got out of their car and gazed around.

33
00:02:09.152 --> 00:02:11.754
glad we escaped that awful monkey," Dwight said.

34
00:02:11.774 --> 00:02:16.898
"That monkey didn't scare me," Earl said with a snort.

35
00:02:16.918 --> 00:02:20.220
"What?" Dwight shook his head.

36
00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:23.302
"You screamed and ran, just like I did!"

37
00:02:23.322 --> 00:02:26.344
"I thought the monkey was really scary!"

38
00:02:26.725 --> 00:02:27.385
a voice said.

39
00:02:27.405 --> 00:02:29.607
Dwight looked around.

40
00:02:29.627 --> 00:02:31.068
"Who said that?"

41
00:02:32.604 --> 00:02:34.766
A squirrel walked calmly along a fence.

42
00:02:35.827 --> 00:02:36.928
"I did."

43
00:02:36.948 --> 00:02:39.810
"Do you hear that, Dwight?"

44
00:02:40.151 --> 00:02:40.691
Earl said.

45
00:02:40.711 --> 00:02:42.693
"It's a talking squirrel!"

46
00:02:42.713 --> 00:02:46.556
"First we saw a talking monkey," Dwight said.

47
00:02:46.576 --> 00:02:51.500
"Now we see a talking squirrel What in the world is going on?"

48
00:02:52.982 --> 00:02:55.684
The squirrel sat on its hind legs and quickly changed shape.

49
00:02:57.706 --> 00:02:58.907
"It's the monkey!"

50
00:02:59.327 --> 00:03:00.228
Dwight and Earl yelled.

51
00:03:01.192 --> 00:03:03.574
"Yes, it's me," Wukong said with a grin.

52
00:03:03.594 --> 00:03:06.855
"And you two fools are under arrest!"

53
00:03:08.136 --> 00:03:11.318
The men tried to flee, but Wukong jumped in front of them.

54
00:03:11.598 --> 00:03:15.360
He grabbed each man by the arm and yelled, "You're coming with me!"

55
00:03:16.561 --> 00:03:20.363
Still holding the men, Wukong leaped into the air and hopped onto a cloud.

56
00:03:21.284 --> 00:03:26.947
Whoosh! "Whoa, Dwight, we're flying!"

57
00:03:27.307 --> 00:03:27.808
Earl said.

58
00:03:29.028 --> 00:03:31.349
Dwight squeezed his eyes shut and didn't answer.

59
00:03:33.289 --> 00:03:37.710
Back in Metro City, Wukong returned to True Savings Bank and found Detective Smith.

60
00:03:37.730 --> 00:03:39.751
"Here you go, Detective!"

61
00:03:39.971 --> 00:03:41.091
Wukong said with a grin.

62
00:03:41.111 --> 00:03:45.032
"I caught the robbers, and I didn't smash them to pieces!"

63
00:03:45.052 --> 00:03:50.394
"Nice work, Wukong," Detective Smith said, looking pleased.

64
00:03:52.475 --> 00:03:55.715
Detective Smith and Wukong took Dwight and Earl to Metro City Jail.

65
00:03:56.436 --> 00:03:57.496
Wukong looked around.

66
00:03:58.328 --> 00:04:00.049
"Do you have many villains in this jail?"

67
00:04:01.089 --> 00:04:02.130
Detective Smith shrugged.

68
00:04:02.150 --> 00:04:03.830
"Not too many."

69
00:04:04.871 --> 00:04:06.351
Wukong heard someone snoring.

70
00:04:06.371 --> 00:04:11.273
"Is that His words trailed off as he listened carefully.

71
00:04:12.274 --> 00:04:17.076
Zzz-zz! "I recognize that snore!"

72
00:04:17.376 --> 00:04:18.176
Wukong said.

73
00:04:18.956 --> 00:04:22.058
He ran over to a cell where a large pig was fast asleep.

74
00:04:23.678 --> 00:04:24.659
Wukong laughed.

75
00:04:25.459 --> 00:04:26.579
"I've found
